WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.361
"Side Effects of Resveratrol Supplements"

00:00:07.443 --> 00:00:08.340
If you do have a condition

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.860
that might benefit from
resveratrol supplementation,

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.500
like diabetic foot ulcers,
or ulcerative colitis,

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.700
or menopausal pains,

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.980
and want to give resveratrol
a try,

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.160
are there any concerns,
aside from the cost,

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.900
which can exceed $10 a day?

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.380
Well, although a meta-analysis
of studies of resveratrol

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.080
found no overall effect
on LDL cholesterol levels,

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.060
a couple studies
found that resveratrol

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.520
sometimes increased LDL levels,

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.740
up to 25 percent over placebo.

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:38.400
As cardiovascular disease
is by far the leading killer

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.120
of diabetics,

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:43.680
as well as other conditions
for which you might take it,

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.440
if you do try resveratrol,
please make sure

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.960
to have your cholesterol
closely monitored.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:52.140
The scientific literature
regarding resveratrol

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:54.540
and cardiovascular health
in general is said to be

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:57.420
"replete with conflicting
information and controversy."

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:58.920
There are no human studies

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.780
on cardiovascular disease
outcomes,

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.880
but an often-overlooked study

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:07.140
found that resveratrol caused
atherosclerosis in rabbits.

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:08.700
The study, entitled

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:10.980
"Resveratrol promotes
atherosclerosis

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:12.720
in hypercholesterolemic
rabbits,"

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.240
found that the hardening
of the arteries of bunnies

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:18.720
fed dietary cholesterol
was worsened by resveratrol.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:22.080
But, negative or null findings
are often marginalized

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.640
by the resveratrol
research community;

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.560
so, you rarely hear about them.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.980
Though there are
no long-term safety data,

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.100
450 milligrams a day
has been considered a safe dose,

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.560
at least in the short term,
for a 60 kilogram person

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:37.080
(that's like 130 pounds),
but supplementation

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:39.420
at higher doses
could be potentially toxic.

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:42.780
Daily doses of resveratrol
in excess of a gram

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:45.840
commonly cause mild to moderate
gastrointestinal symptoms,

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:48.540
such as nausea, diarrhea,
abdominal pain,

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.000
as well as "anal itchiness."

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:53.580
Unexpected renal toxicity

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.740
with cases
of severe kidney failure

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.660
were noted
in a five-gram-a-day study,

00:01:57.660 --> 00:02:00.060
but this was in the context
of a cancer

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:02.460
that is particularly hard
on the kidneys.

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:06.060
Two studies, however, found
that so-called "safe" levels

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:09.060
of resveratrol
(at 150 to 250 milligrams a day)

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:11.280
may blunt
some of the positive effects

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.540
of exercise training.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:16.020
In rodents, resveratrol
supplementation decreases

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:17.340
cardiovascular risk factors

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:19.020
and improves
cardiovascular function

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:20.040
and physical capacity.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.860
But, when it was
put to the test in older men

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:25.860
(with an average age of 65),
the exact opposite was found.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.040
Specifically,
combining resveratrol

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:31.440
with athletic training
abolished the reduction

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:33.480
in blood pressure, cholesterol,
and triglycerides

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:34.800
normally associated
with exercise,

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:38.760
had a more artery-constricting
effect than a dilating one,

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.920
and led to a significantly
lower increase

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.300
in aerobic fitness.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:46.440
Rodents on resveratrol get
enhanced exercise performance,

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:48.960
but, in people,
the resveratrol induced

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:52.320
a 45 percent lower increase
in maximum aerobic capacity

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:53.820
compared with those
taking a sugar pill.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.500
For all their working out,

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:58.500
the resveratrol
was undercutting their efforts.

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.660
An apparent impairment
in peak aerobic power

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:02.220
was also noted in young men

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:04.680
following high-intensity
interval training

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.780
on resveratrol
compared to placebo.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:10.380
A recent review
overreacted to these data

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:12.480
by suggesting "foods
containing resveratrol

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.920
should not be consumed
during exercise,"

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.760
but to even reach
the lower dose of 150 milligrams

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.500
you'd have to eat
more than like

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.000
a hundred pounds
of grapes a day.

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:24.360
Though, I suppose
if you did manage to stuff

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:25.440
in a hundred pounds of grapes,

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:27.900
it might, indeed,
be a little impairing.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:31.920
The exercise impairment
with resveratrol supplements

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:35.160
does make sense, though,
given its purported mechanism.

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.860
Sirtuin activation
by resveratrol

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.480
is thought to occur
via the activation

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.820
of the body's fuel gauge, AMPK,

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.100
by interfering
with energy production

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:47.220
in the mitochondria powerplants
in our cells.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:51.360
Mouse cells react by increasing
mitochondria to compensate,

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.160
but human cells
apparently do not;

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:56.580
so, the energy-dimming effect
of resveratrol

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:59.760
may explain why the effects
of exercise are impaired.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.900
What works in animals may not
necessarily work in people.

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:07.920
Thus, concluded one review,
the hype regarding resveratrol

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:09.180
may "turn out to be
nothing more

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.760
than a sleight-of-hand
marketing device

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:15.000
using peer-reviewed, published,
non-human research

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:15.600
as a cover."

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:19.620
Although some like Dr. Oz
have recommended resveratrol

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.600
as a life-extending
"miracle molecule,"

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.700
given that evidence-based
responses

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.200
are sparse-and-controversial

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.780
such "claims, innuendo,
and hyperbole"

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.880
are said to be "atrocious."

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:34.020
The fitness-blunting exercise
study of older adults

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:36.780
was supported in part
by a manufacturer

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.160
of resveratrol supplements.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.800
To their credit,
the researchers responded

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.800
to an angry letter from
a supplement company consultant

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:47.340
that "it is our opinion
that we, as scientists,

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:49.920
have a responsibility
to report what we find

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.780
and not to twist our findings

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.700
to fit
the commercial interests."

